{"pageid":2194,"title":"Duck Shrine","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Duck Shrine</span>","revid":20726,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Duck Shrine</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2c/Duck_shrine.png/revision/latest?cb=20240226184306\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Duck shrine\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2c/Duck_shrine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240226184306\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2c/Duck_shrine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240226184306 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2c/Duck_shrine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240226184306 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Duck shrine\" width=\"270\" height=\"205\" data-image-key=\"Duck_shrine.png\" data-image-name=\"Duck shrine.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">N/A</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Adult Ducky</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Introduction\">Introduction</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Duck Shrine</b> is a small cave with an underwater entrance. The shrine contains a pedestal of which to place an item, and two duck statues to either side. Before use, the Duck Shrine has a green glow with particles floating around the air nearby. The entrance is located to the right of the short arch bridge between the <i>Taiga</i> and the <i>Grasslands</i> in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a>. \n</p><p>To access the entrance, players must swim through the water to the hole and emerge at the duck shrine. Players will need to bring the <a href=\"/wiki/Baby_Ducky\" title=\"Baby Ducky\">Baby Ducky</a> along in order to receive the Adult Ducky. \n</p><p>Once used, the Duck Shrine's particles and glow will turn yellow. There is a cooldown, and it will last roughly a minute before it can be used again.\n</p><p>\nIn order to exit with an Adult Ducky, players must swim across to the exit. There is a large hole on the Grasslands side of the bridge. Players will find a ladder to climb out.</p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"1a110af5a4c0851439f73c8024d35112\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:142px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Duck_Shrine_red-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:106px; width:185px; top:17px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Duck_Shrine_red.png\" title=\"Duck Shrine red.png (2.09 MB)\" style=\"height:106px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Duck_Shrine_red.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240303112900\" title=\"Duck Shrine red.png (2.09 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"140\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Duck Shrine red.png\" data-image-key=\"Duck_Shrine_red.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Duck Shrine red.png (2.09 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"140\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Duck Shrine red.png\" data-image-key=\"Duck_Shrine_red.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Duck_Shrine_red.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240303112900\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:142px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent